+#
+# Per-turn item cap and confidence floor for the extracted facts.
+# MEMORY_AUTO_EXTRACT_MAX_ITEMS=3
+# MEMORY_AUTO_EXTRACT_CONFIDENCE=0.7
+#
+# --- Cost controls (Story 8.7 / AR-6 / RS-1) ---
+#
+# IMPORTANT — what bounds extraction spend, and what does not. The wallet
+# pre-check below is an *eligibility* gate: it skips this optional background
+# work for an owner who cannot pay for their foreground work. It is NOT a spend
+# meter. Extraction does not debit the credit wallet: per AD-8 the wallet-debit
+# surface is ETL pages / premium model calls / deep-research, and the
+# ``memory_create`` TokenUsage row extraction writes is an observability record
+# (Story 8.9), not a debit. So the only bounds that actually apply to extraction
